  "body": "Clear Instructions: To Be Sold By Auction!\r\n\r\nHeld as a reliable investment for the past five years, this spacious 4-to-5 bedroom weatherboard and tile home presents an unmissable opportunity in a blue-chip\r\nEastern Bays pocket. \r\n\r\nOur vendors have issued clear instructions-this property is moving on, creating a golden opportunity for families, investors, or smart buyers\r\nlooking to add immediate value.\r\n\r\nStructurally sound and exceptionally well-designed, the home features a highly versatile layout. While a cosmetic refresh and a lick of paint will easily restore its\r\noriginal sparkle, the core fundamentals here are absolutely rock-solid.\r\n\r\n*  Auction motivation: Clear vendor instructions to sell on the day, creating an unmissable opportunity.\r\n*  Prime location: Easy walking distance to Eastridge shops, Eastern Bays beaches, St Thomas Primary, and Selwyn College.\r\n*  Flexible footprint: Four upstairs bedrooms plus a large downstairs lounge with separate entry for a fifth bedroom or office.\r\n*  Value-add potential: Structurally sound weatherboard and tile property ready for a cosmetic refresh to unlock immediate equity.\r\n\r\nViewing at advertised open-homes or by Appointment, contact Alastair  on 021 0221 5939.",
